(split-thrust)
*title Propulsive force aggregation
*atmos none
*earth spherical gm=0 omega=0
*trajectory 1 vehicle start on 1
  *initial ecfc x=20925646.3255 y=0 z=0 xdt=0 ydt=0 zdt=0 time=0 mass=10
  *file thrust.dat time xecfc xecfcdt thrust
  *segment 1 burn
    *integ dtprnt=0.5 dt=0.05
    *inertial ecfc
    *prop thrust=10 mdot=0
    *prop thrust=10 mdot=0
    *fly yawi=0
    *fly pitchi=0
    *fly rolli=0
    *when time=5 stop
*end
